; delta-meta for S10 -> S11: Meta gains the crossing for a whole repository,
; which is what a chain needs -- a claim about one artifact travels as one
; artifact, and a claim about a history travels as every object in it, with
; its names kept.
(change
  (kind delta-meta)
  (name "S10->S11 delta-meta")
  (replace
    (ReplaceChange
      second-floor-language
      (storing strata)
      (remembering strata))))
